::hs_policy_q_excerpt [display=target:hs_main label="Abstract, Introduction, Background"]

Ty: The study focuses on whether differences in the accessibility and generosity of income support programs are related to family homelessness. That makes **“How do income support policies influence family homelessness?”** the best match for the researchers’ central question.

Lacy: That makes sense.

Lianne: I agree. I added it to our table. Let’s work on filling out the rest of the rows for this study.

::hs_policy_table2 [display=target:hs_main label="Comparison table"]

Ty: It looks like for evidence they used **administrative data on student homelessness from public school districts with measures of state-level income support policy generosity and accessibility.**

