Peggy: I chose **Sociology**. The study focuses on social relationships, support systems, structural conditions, and pathways into homelessness. Those are the major phenomena the researchers are trying to understand.

Lianne: Exactly. Those phenomena reflect a sociology perspective because the study examines how social relationships, support systems, and broader social structures interact to shape people’s experiences and pathways into homelessness.

