Wrap-Up: End of Part 1 [id=hs_wrapup]
-------------------------------------

::hs_part1_end [display=target:hs_main label="End of Part 1"]

Lianne: Good work! This ends Part 1 of the SBA. Let’s recap what we have done so far.

  We brainstormed and learned about causes of homelessness. That helped us understand this is a complex problem with multiple parts, which makes it suitable for interdisciplinary study. We then located sources from different disciplines shedding light and insight on those causes.

  You've spent a lot of time understanding how each discipline explains homelessness from its own perspective. Our next challenge is different. Instead of studying the perspectives one at a time, in Part 2 we'll begin exploring how they connect to one another to develop a more comprehensive understanding of homelessness.
